        "id": "YorickR",
        "name": "Eulogy of the Isles",
        "description": "Yorick summons the Maiden of the Mist that causes Yorick's attacks against the Maiden's target to deal bonus damage. The Maiden will also automatically raise Walkers from dead enemies.",
        "tooltip": "Yorick summons the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Maiden of the Mist</span> with <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(1050 + (60% bonus Health)) Health</span> and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/75/100 + (30% bonus Attack Damage)) Magic Attack Damage</span> plus 2/3/4 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mist Walkers</span>. The <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Maiden</span> automatically raises <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mist Walkers</span> from nearby enemy deaths and marks enemy Champions with her attacks. When Yorick damages the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Maiden's</span> target, he deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">2/2.5/3% max Health magic damage</span>.<br /><br />After 10 seconds, Yorick can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability to free the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Maiden</span>, sending her down the nearest lane.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Maiden of the Mist</span><br /><span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">30 Armor</span><br /><span>30 Magic Resist</span><br />Takes 30% damage from lane minions</span>",
